# PartyLeaderWizardDD2CurseAggressive (21090, level 75; the npc line gives the debuff 4117, the long range
# DD 4152 and the short range DD 4160 the template lists), every draw 0: seeing the character once
# settled (8 ticks past its life time of 7) inside its spawn territory it casts the debuff at it
# (draw under 33) and wants the short range DD (the character stands within 100) as well.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.WizardBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.PartyLeaderWizard.PartyLeaderWizard
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.PartyLeaderWizard.PartyLeaderWizardDD2
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.PartyLeaderWizard.PartyLeaderWizardDD2CurseAggressive
npc wiz 21090 Monster 600 0 0 level 75 skill DEBUFF 4117 8 skill W_LONG_RANGE_DD_MAGIC 4152 8 skill W_SHORT_RANGE_DD_MAGIC 4160 8

tick x8
approach wiz
  S MagicSkillUse caster=wiz target=player skill=4117-8 hit=15857 reuse=21142 success=0
  mem wiz i_ai0=0
  desires wiz cast(player,4117,move)=934000 cast(player,4160,move)=934000
